  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x205">
    <title>Wheel-speed sensor MODE  [enter 4=VDA stock / 2=edge-pulse] CODE+RESIGN</title>
    <description>Sensor acquisition mode returned by sub_075A44 for ALL 4 wheels. ENTER 4 or 2 ONLY. 4 = VDA encoded active sensor (stock; presence via ASIC reply popcount&gt;=3). 2 = raw edge/pulse presence from the eTPU capture path 0x40339E (plausible if period diff in [6..25]). Any other number -&gt; every wheel latches a WSS DTC at cycle 100. This edits CODE (movi r3,imm at CPU 0x75A56 / file 0x7DA56), so you MUST re-sign the image afterward: python tools/bmy_resign.py fix. Mode 2 keeps its own plausibility window + confidence counters -&gt; bench-verify before relying on it.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="5" />
    <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x00" mmedaddress="0x7da56" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
    <units>mode</units>
    <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
    <outputtype>2</outputtype>
    <datatype>0</datatype>
    <unittype>0</unittype>
    <DALINK index="0" />
    <MATH equation="(X-24579)/16">
      <VAR id="X" />
    </MATH>
  </XDFCONSTANT>
