  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x2A0">
    <title>ABS cornering lat-g pressure term A (0x40E0A): clamp min</title>
    <description>ABS cornering lateral-g pressure term (A, primary, +5 bar boost >0.8 g; classify 0x51B54 -> code-32 exec 0x58FF4). x = |lateral accel| (byte 0x408ECA) ~0.01 g/count; curve output x100 -> 0.01 bar. RISES with lateral g (26->49 bar over 0->1.27 g) = a lateral-LOAD pressure term, NOT a knockdown. Exact role (per-wheel ceiling vs reference) UNCONFIRMED; the code-32 rear knockdown uses a SEPARATE pct byte 0x408DE0 (producer untraced). Verified bytes; see analysis/agents/abs_full/03_lateral_g_influence.md. Re-sign MISR 0x4249C + BMY after edits.</description>
